# Ahmad Badawi Portfolio — Environment Variables
#
# This project is a static SPA (React + Vite) and does NOT require any
# environment variables at runtime. All content is bundled at build time.
#
# If you add features that need env vars in the future, prefix browser-safe
# variables with VITE_ (e.g. VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=).
# Server-only secrets must NOT use the VITE_ prefix.
